  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "『GUNDAM FACTORY YOKOHAMA』の動く実物大ガンダムの限定商品！",
      "en": "Limited edition moving life-sized Gundam from “GUNDAM FACTORY YOKOHAMA”!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "プロトタイプカラー＆高機動仕様にアレンジされた“RX-78F00 ガンダム”を、1/144スケールでキット化。",
      "en": "The “RX-78F00 Gundam” arranged in prototype color and high mobility specifications is now a kit in 1/144 scale."
    },
    {
      "ja": "HIGH MOBILTY TYPE(高機動型)として簡易装着式の増加装甲、補助バーニア、武装を追加。",
      "en": "Added easy-to-install additional armor, auxiliary vernier, and armament as HIGH MOBILTY TYPE."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• RX-78F00 ガンダムの特徴的なフォルムや装甲のパネルラインを精密に再現。",
      "en": "• Accurately reproduces the RX-78F00 Gundam's characteristic form and armor panel lines."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 高機動ユニットは着脱が可能。プロトタイプガンダムの特徴的なアンクルガードも新規造形で再現。",
      "en": "• High mobility unit is removable. The characteristic ankle guard of the prototype Gundam is also reproduced with new modeling."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 各種武装とハンドパーツが付属。",
      "en": "• Various weapons and hand parts are included."
    }
  ],
